# Files exposed read-only at /AOK/tests, embedded into the kernel by
# tools/gen-aokfs.py at build time (see meson.build / fs/aok.c).
#
# Each line: <filename> [mode]
#   <filename>  is read from tests/manual/<filename> and served at
#               /AOK/tests/<filename>.
#   [mode]      optional octal permission bits. Defaults: .sh -> 0555,
#               everything else -> 0444.
#
# To add a regression to /AOK/tests, add its source under tests/manual/ and
# list it here -- the next build picks it up automatically. Order here is the
# order shown by `ls /AOK/tests`.

